            <div xml:id="d414">

                <pb facs="0556" n="442" xml:id="pg442"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.01/149: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mayer</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-12-10T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 10,
                                1924—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>309. Your telegram No. 478, December 9, 5 p.m.</p>
                <p>I am much gratified by this result, and approve your action with regard to
                    modifications of draft which seem entirely satisfactory.</p>
                <p>Repeat the above to Tokyo as the Department’s number 207, together with your 478,
                    December 9, 5 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
